ir project is to chose one or two associate artists to help them prepare each edition of the Festival)uhttp://www.festival-avignon.com/fr/  aWikipedia, viewed Mar. 22, 2018b(The Festival d'Avignon, or Avignon Festival, is an annual arts festival held in the French city of Avignon every summer in July in the courtyard of the Palais des Papes as well as in other locations of the city)  aMEETI_NAME00268cz  a2200121n  450000100060000000300040000600500170001000800410002704000080006810000330007640000220010994200150013140924DLC20250814122935.0880425n| acannaabn          |a aaa     c  aInU1 aGuide, Richard ded1909-19621 aDe Guide, Richard  aPERSO_NAME00228cz  a2200109n  450000100060000000300040000600500170001000800410002704000080006810000270007694200150010340925DLC20250814123053.0840114n| azannaabn          |n aaa        aDLC1 aAbsil, Jeand1893-1974  aPERSO_NAME00230cz  a2200109n  450000100060000000300040000600500170001000800410002704000080006810000290007694200150010540926DLC20250814124751.0831017n| azannaabn          |n aaa        aDLC1 aSmith, Ronaldd1922-2004  aPERSO_NAME00766cz  a2200229n  450000100060000000300040000600500170001000800410002702400860006804000080015410000390016240000200020140000230022140000180024440000170026240000270027940000340030694200150034055000500035555100560040551000750046140927DLC20260330112912.0820115n| azannaabn          |a aaa        1http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q2170682WikidataaQ2170689Charles-Valentin Alkan  aDLC1 aAlkan, Charles-Valentind1813-18881 aAlkan, Valentin1 aMorhange, Valentin1 aAlkan, Ch. V.1 aAlkan, C. V.1 aAlkan, Carlo-Valentino1 aAlkan, Charles Henri Valentin  aPERSO_NAME  ihttp://wikidata.org/entity/P130392810aOrgan  aParis (France)9160ihttp://wikidata.org/entity/P19  920895ihttp://wikidata.org/entity/P69aConservatoire de Paris (France)00226nz  a2200109n  4500001000600000003000300006005001700009008004100026040000700067100002700074942001